## 📈 查询示例

### 常用查询

#### 查询 1: {查询说明}

```sql
SELECT *
FROM {table_name}
WHERE {condition}
ORDER BY {field}
LIMIT {limit};
```

#### 查询 2: {查询说明}

```sql
SELECT t1.*, t2.{field}
FROM {table_1} t1
JOIN {table_2} t2 ON t1.{foreign_key} = t2.id
WHERE t1.{condition};
```

